Package: clevofan-dkms
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dkms, kmod, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64
Description: Clevo/Juno EC fan control module (dkms), ec_transaction-serialized
 Builds and installs the clevofan kernel module via dkms, exposing Clevo
 mainboard fan speed and PWM control through standard hwmon sysfs
 attributes for lm-sensors, pwmconfig and fancontrol.
 .
 This fork sends every EC access through the kernel's ACPI EC driver
 (ec_transaction() and ec_read()), replacing raw port I/O that raced it, and
 drives the V5xTNC_TND_TNE second fan through the generic mapping
 (control index 2, tach 0xD2/0xD3).
